    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the world to find treasures!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything starts with a spot on a treasure map...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find it as fast as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock zoom levels to give you hints about its position!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins to get more themed maps!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your treasures!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the game editor to place your  treasures and share your customized game with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don't even need to own the game to play it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No subscriptions, no ads!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as much as you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't need to buy an additional pass to play the game! \ud83d\udc40</p>",
